    "description": "The autorino package (for Assisted Unloading, Treatment & Organisation of RINex Observations) is designed for automated download and conversion of GNSS raw data from the main manufacturers’ receivers (Leica, Septentrio, Topcon, Trimble, and BINEX) based on their respective official conversion utilities. A special focus is put on conversion to RINEX3/4 and near real-time capability (download frequency up to 15 min).",
